{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_retenir","introduces":[{"id":"idee","type":"text","content":"Sans remise : le deuxième tirage a un univers réduit.","layout":{"to_corner":"top_left"}},{"id":"regle","type":"math","content":"P(\\text{1 rouge sur 2}) = \\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{3}{7} + \\frac{3}{8} \\times \\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{27}{56}","layout":{"next_to":"idee","direction":"down","gap":"md"}}],"beats":[{"id":"recap","say":"À retenir : sans remise, le deuxième tirage n'a plus 8 boules mais 7, donc les fractions du bas changent. On multiplie sur chaque chemin, puis on additionne les chemins qui donnent exactement une rouge.","cues":[{"id":"c_retenir","text":"À retenir"},{"id":"c_7","text":"7"},{"id":"c_additionne","text":"on additionne"},{"id":"c_une_rouge","text":"une rouge"}],"do":[{"id":"f_eq","verb":"fade_out","target":"eq_chemin","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"f_eq2","verb":"fade_out","target":"eq_chemin2","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"f_exp","verb":"fade_out","target":"explication","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"f_final","verb":"fade_out","target":"final","at":"beat:start"},{"id":"s_idee","verb":"show","target":"idee","at":"cue:c_retenir"},{"id":"w_regle","verb":"write","target":"regle","at":"cue:c_additionne"},{"id":"h_res","verb":"highlight","target":"regle","role":"result","start":"cue:c_une_rouge","end":"cue_end:c_une_rouge"}],"pause_after":"long"}]}}
